{"2934520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Go Up", "steam_appid": 2934520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you get? Find out while you Go Up, experiencing a relaxing and atmospheric exploration into darkness and creation. What is the meaning of life? Why do we yearn for progress? Where did I leave my keys? None of these questions will be answered in the course of your long and often times confusing journey to the highest ascents of the firmament.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect dust, spice, chaos and more as you ascend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/1e35ef69b92d4cca7bde365cb594bbbb.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/1e35ef69b92d4cca7bde365cb594bbbb.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/1e35ef69b92d4cca7bde365cb594bbbb.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn <strong>Spice</strong> to boost and accumulate <strong>Chaos</strong> to trigger a random <strong>Chaotic Event</strong>. Collect enough <strong>Dust</strong> and you’ll earn a <strong>Golden Dust</strong> to spend on upgrading your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey through vast and varied environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/7194d6112250716589a42d803acf48c0.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/7194d6112250716589a42d803acf48c0.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/7194d6112250716589a42d803acf48c0.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through 11 unique and vibrant regions as you traverse the realms, ascending from the pits of 🔥<strong>Tartarus</strong>🔥 through ❀<strong>Elysium</strong>❀ and beyond into the  heavenly ✧<strong>Cosmos</strong>✧.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the beasts that lurk in the depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/e102dd7e3c3e2a478de16563ee65cdcf.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/e102dd7e3c3e2a478de16563ee65cdcf.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/e102dd7e3c3e2a478de16563ee65cdcf.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creeping spiders, grabbing tentacles, and darker nameless things lurk in the depths, waiting to impede your ever upward journey. But fear not, there is no challenge that can not be overcome with wit and bravery, and lots and lots of upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/d7579e98d774957dbccaddb27ab69f1a.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/d7579e98d774957dbccaddb27ab69f1a.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/d7579e98d774957dbccaddb27ab69f1a.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not all monsters and darkness. There are great rewards to be found scattered throughout the realms, as long as you know where to look. And if you ever get tired of the grind you can always kick back and do some fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/ecb95f5ceee9ca98ece980d70ad3f1ef.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/ecb95f5ceee9ca98ece980d70ad3f1ef.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/ecb95f5ceee9ca98ece980d70ad3f1ef.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you’re not going up, you’re going down</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press any button to Go Up, but don’t stop pressing, or you will go down. When the game is not running, you are falling, so keep your finger on that button!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend Golden Dust to purchase upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/a922b4a3545cab580c4633ee7652ccc8.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/a922b4a3545cab580c4633ee7652ccc8.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/a922b4a3545cab580c4633ee7652ccc8.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive skill tree offers a nearly endless array of unique skills to help you Go Up faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve got 🧲<strong>Magnets</strong>🧲.  <br>We’ve got <strong>🚀Boosters🚀</strong>. <br>We've got <strong>🛡️Shields🛡️.</strong> <br>We’ve got <strong>⏫Accelerators⏫</strong> and 🚫⏬<strong>Anti-Decelarators</strong>⏬🚫.  <br>Or you can save up your <strong>Golden Dust</strong> for the ultimate purchase, the skill that lets you Go Up <i>automatically</i> without a single button press. True idle perfection.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/8ad4220cd496ada465f4328fc11561ee.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/8ad4220cd496ada465f4328fc11561ee.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/8ad4220cd496ada465f4328fc11561ee.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes peeled as you explore this strange realm of possibilities. There are secrets that hide in the darkness waiting to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global and Friend High Scores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/987b045563cffc10459d845ab50a2d55.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=300 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/987b045563cffc10459d845ab50a2d55.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/987b045563cffc10459d845ab50a2d55.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends and the world to see who can get the highest. Pass the ghostly echo of another player’s high score to knock them off the leader board, exploding their ghost into valuable<strong> dust</strong> that you can collect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♫ ♪ ♬<strong> Music to put you in the zone </strong>♫ ♪ ♬</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe to the chill ambient tones of exclusive music by Stephen Garza.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you get? Find out while you Go Up, experiencing a relaxing and atmospheric exploration into darkness and creation. What is the meaning of life? Why do we yearn for progress? Where did I leave my keys? None of these questions will be answered in the course of your long and often times confusing journey to the highest ascents of the firmament.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect dust, spice, chaos and more as you ascend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/1e35ef69b92d4cca7bde365cb594bbbb.poster.avif?t=1788221021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/1e35ef69b92d4cca7bde365cb594bbbb.webm?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/1e35ef69b92d4cca7bde365cb594bbbb.mp4?t=1788221021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn <strong>Spice</strong> to boost and accumulate <strong>Chaos</strong> to trigger a random <strong>Chaotic